Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.99,0:00:19.65,Legenda,,0,0,0,,Aqui é a Pixelzada.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.67,0:00:22.43,Legenda,,0,0,0,,Neste vídeo a gente atravessa o mapa de GTA 6
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.45,0:00:24.98,Legenda,,0,0,0,,de ponta a ponta: a cidade, as praias, as
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.00,0:00:27.36,Legenda,,0,0,0,,ilhas, o pântano e até a tal montanha.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.38,0:00:30.58,Legenda,,0,0,0,,E em cada parada eu te mostro o que a Rockstar
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.60,0:00:32.09,Legenda,,0,0,0,,copiou da vida real.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.11,0:00:34.38,Legenda,,0,0,0,,Se você vai jogar no lançamento, já se
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.40,0:00:36.77,Legenda,,0,0,0,,inscreve, porque essa semana o canal vai
Dialogue: 0,0:00:36.79,0:00:37.33,Legenda,,0,0,0,,ferver.
