Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.70,0:00:39.55,Legenda,,0,0,0,,Primeiro, um pouco de história.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:39.57,0:00:41.80,Legenda,,0,0,0,,Vice City não é novidade na série.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:41.82,0:00:45.06,Legenda,,0,0,0,,Ela apareceu em 2002, em GTA Vice City, presa
Dialogue: 0,0:00:45.08,0:00:48.12,Legenda,,0,0,0,,nos anos oitenta, com terno pastel, neon e
Dialogue: 0,0:00:48.14,0:00:49.89,Legenda,,0,0,0,,trilha de sintetizador.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:49.91,0:00:51.93,Legenda,,0,0,0,,Era a Miami dos filmes de crime.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.95,0:00:55.08,Legenda,,0,0,0,,Mais de vinte anos depois, a cidade volta.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:55.10,0:00:57.99,Legenda,,0,0,0,,Só que agora nos dias de hoje, com celular na
Dialogue: 0,0:00:58.01,0:01:00.84,Legenda,,0,0,0,,mão, rede social e todo mundo filmando tudo.
Dialogue: 1,0:00:37.85,0:00:39.47,Etiqueta,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,150)}GTA VICE CITY · 2002
Dialogue: 1,0:00:39.72,0:00:41.72,Etiqueta,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,150)}GTA VICE CITY · 2002
