Dialogue: 0,0:01:27.28,0:01:30.61,Legenda,,0,0,0,,Até agora, a Rockstar mostrou seis regiões.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:30.63,0:01:33.08,Legenda,,0,0,0,,Vice City, a capital do neon.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:33.10,0:01:36.12,Legenda,,0,0,0,,Leonida Keys, o colar de ilhas no sul.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:36.14,0:01:38.15,Legenda,,0,0,0,,Grassrivers, o pântano.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:38.17,0:01:40.48,Legenda,,0,0,0,,Port Gellhorn, na costa do Golfo.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:40.50,0:01:42.26,Legenda,,0,0,0,,Ambrosia, no interior.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:42.28,0:01:45.41,Legenda,,0,0,0,,E o Mount Kalaga, um parque nacional no norte.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:45.43,0:01:47.06,Legenda,,0,0,0,,Vamos uma por uma.
