Dialogue: 0,0:02:15.54,0:02:15.65,Legenda,,0,0,0,,Tem mais.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:15.67,0:02:18.79,Legenda,,0,0,0,,Miami é conhecida como a capital mundial dos
Dialogue: 0,0:02:18.81,0:02:22.06,Legenda,,0,0,0,,cruzeiros, e Vice City tem porto, iate, lancha
Dialogue: 0,0:02:22.08,0:02:23.94,Legenda,,0,0,0,,e jet ski para todo lado.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:23.96,0:02:26.85,Legenda,,0,0,0,,Os prédios espelhados do centro, as pontes
Dialogue: 0,0:02:26.87,0:02:29.89,Legenda,,0,0,0,,ligando a cidade à praia, as festas na beira
Dialogue: 0,0:02:29.91,0:02:30.54,Legenda,,0,0,0,,do mar.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:30.56,0:02:33.45,Legenda,,0,0,0,,Quem já viu Miami de perto vai reconhecer a
Dialogue: 0,0:02:33.47,0:02:34.84,Legenda,,0,0,0,,cidade em segundos.
