Dialogue: 0,0:02:35.21,0:02:38.34,Legenda,,0,0,0,,Descendo para o sul, chegamos em Leonida Keys.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:38.36,0:02:41.31,Legenda,,0,0,0,,Na vida real, as Florida Keys são uma corrente
Dialogue: 0,0:02:41.33,0:02:44.28,Legenda,,0,0,0,,de ilhas ligadas por uma única estrada sobre o
Dialogue: 0,0:02:44.30,0:02:47.12,Legenda,,0,0,0,,mar, a Overseas Highway, com quarenta e duas
Dialogue: 0,0:02:47.14,0:02:47.73,Legenda,,0,0,0,,pontes.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:47.75,0:02:50.88,Legenda,,0,0,0,,Uma delas tem quase onze quilômetros.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:50.90,0:02:53.92,Legenda,,0,0,0,,É água azul-turquesa dos dois lados, barco de
Dialogue: 0,0:02:53.94,0:02:56.90,Legenda,,0,0,0,,pesca, bar de praia e muita gente fugindo da
Dialogue: 0,0:02:56.92,0:02:57.53,Legenda,,0,0,0,,cidade.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:57.55,0:03:00.54,Legenda,,0,0,0,,Nos trailers, essa vibe aparece em festa em
Dialogue: 0,0:03:00.56,0:03:03.35,Legenda,,0,0,0,,barco, passeio de lancha e areia branca.
