Dialogue: 0,0:03:31.99,0:03:34.95,Legenda,,0,0,0,,Do outro lado do estado, na costa do Golfo,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:34.97,0:03:36.38,Legenda,,0,0,0,,fica Port Gellhorn.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:36.40,0:03:38.94,Legenda,,0,0,0,,Se Vice City é o cartão-postal, Port Gellhorn
Dialogue: 0,0:03:38.96,0:03:40.70,Legenda,,0,0,0,,é a praia que ficou para trás.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:40.72,0:03:43.83,Legenda,,0,0,0,,Cidade portuária, motel de beira de estrada,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:43.85,0:03:47.10,Legenda,,0,0,0,,casa noturna com letreiro piscando e bem menos
Dialogue: 0,0:03:47.12,0:03:47.83,Legenda,,0,0,0,,glamour.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:47.85,0:03:50.30,Legenda,,0,0,0,,Tudo indica que a inspiração vem do norte da
Dialogue: 0,0:03:50.32,0:03:52.66,Legenda,,0,0,0,,costa do Golfo da Flórida, a região que os
Dialogue: 0,0:03:52.68,0:03:54.45,Legenda,,0,0,0,,americanos chamam de Panhandle.
